    {
      "id": "over.p2",
      "text": "Minimum €1 bill based on our own measures. If usage doesn't meet our metered amount, it's not billed for that month.",
      "original": "Minimum €1 bill based on our own measures. If usage doesn't meet our metered amount, it's not billed for that month.",
