      "id": "start.p1",
      "text": "Create an account in seconds, deploy your first CARLOS app in minutes.",
      "original": "Create an account at console.carloku.com. You sign in with a passkey through Keymail, so there is no password. Every new account starts on Free, and no card is needed. When you want more, open your account's Billing page, choose a plan and pay.",
